          "items": [
            "Bring the whole family to Coola Boola — a custom 5-bedroom, 5.5-bath home at the front of Seacrest Beach with a huge gulf-view top deck, free bikes, easy pool access, and a short walk to deeded beach access.<br><br>Highlights:<br>•\tPrime spot: 1-minute walk to the 12,000 sq ft lagoon pool; 3-minute walk to private beach access; <br>•\tFree, on-demand tram service<br>•\tSea-view top deck with wet bar, full refrigerator, and gas grill — perfect for sunsets and entertaining<br>•\tFree bikes (5), beach towels, chairs, and floats provided<br>•\tFour outdoor decks, gas barbecue, plenty of outdoor seating<br>•\tFamily-friendly layout ideal for multi-family stays; renters must be 25+; no parties<br><br>Sleeping layout (by floor):<br>•\t1st floor: Master suite — King<br>•\t2nd floor: Master suite — King<br>•\t2nd floor: Kids room — 2 twin-over-full bunks + queen sofa sleeper; full bath<br>•\t2nd floor: laundry room<br>•\t3rd floor: Master suite — King with access to top deck; <br>•\t3rd floor: Bunk Room/Office — twin bunk (2 twins) & small office, bathroom<br><br>Interior features:<br>•\tOpen plan living with comfortable seating and a home entertainment center<br>•\tFully equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances, granite counters, and bar seating<br>•\tTVs in every bedroom, Wi Fi, and surround sound in the living area<br><br>Location perks:<br>•\tFront-of-resort position on Trigger Trail East — walkable to pool, Rosemary Beach, and Alys Beach; short drive to Camp Helen State Park, the Big Chill, Seaside, Watercolor, and Grayton State Park<br>•\tNumerous shopping and dining options<br><br>Booking details:<br>•\tNo parties; primary renter must be at least 25<br>•\tIdeal for multi-generational families — spacious living, multiple masters, and abundant outdoor space<br><br>Make lasting beach memories at Coola Boola (Gaelic for 'awesome, fantastic'). Check availability or message with any questions.",
